  "notes": "Sibling of the 1202SFX with 2 mono and 4 stereo channels (from the panel drawing and the shared controls description). Each mono channel has MIC and LINE IN, but only one can be used at a time. USB audio plays on the last stereo channel (9/10) until a jack is plugged in. The guide contradicts itself on MONITOR OUT (controls: unbalanced; specifications: impedance-balanced TRS). Routing lists where a signal can go; LEVEL, FX and STREAM buttons decide what actually reaches an output. DC power input not listed.",
